{
  "slug": "enterprise-search",
  "name": "Enterprise Search",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Search across all of your company's tools in one place. Find anything across email, chat, documents, and wikis without switching between apps.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills** and **7 MCP servers**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `digest` (Generate a daily or weekly digest of activity across all connected sources), `knowledge-synthesis` (Combines search results from multiple sources into coherent, deduplicated answers with source attribution), `search` (Search across all connected sources in one query), `search-strategy` (Query decomposition and multi-source search orchestration), `source-management` (Manages connected MCP sources for enterprise search)\n- **MCP servers** (7): `slack`, `notion`, `guru`, `atlassian`, `asana`, `google calendar`, `gmail`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install enterprise-search@knowledge-work-plugins` from `anthropics/knowledge-work-plugins` (`enterprise-search`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
